# Learn a small research-world theory.
Every researcher is curious.
Every researcher uses AI.
Alice is a researcher and scientist.
Alice is creative.
Bob is a researcher.
Bob is cautious.
If X is researcher and X is curious and X is creative then X is innovative.

# Query and generate.
Is Alice innovative?
Who is researcher and curious?
How many are researcher?
Is anyone innovative?
What does Alice use?
Summarize Alice.
Compare Alice and Bob.
Reflect on whether Bob is innovative.
What would make Bob innovative?
Bob is creative.
Think about whether Bob is innovative.
Inspect your last reasoning.

# Treat a concept as an idea object and generate prose from its symbolic neighborhood.
ExecutableScience is promising.
ExecutableScience improves reproducibility.
ExecutableScience reduces manual-review.
ExecutableScience supports automation.
Summarize the idea ExecutableScience.
Expand the idea ExecutableScience.
Write a short paragraph about ExecutableScience.
Summarize the knowledge base.
